Modifications:
            These are adapted extracts, not copies of the source files. For
            each <Row> of the Genericode files, the columns Name (en),
            parentCode (CPV only), nld_label and fra_label were selected and
            re-serialised as a JSON object keyed by code. No code was added,
            removed or renamed, and no label text was edited. The JSON shape
            is this repository's; the codes and labels are the upstream
            project's.

            The extraction was performed once, for release 1.15.1, and is not
            regenerated automatically. rust/data/codelists-README.md records
            the source files and the regeneration procedure.

